 addition of the action bar and tooltipsAdjus","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T22:36:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692954","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:47:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4834760-1837955055364204","game_id":"steam-4834760","kind":"announcement","title":"Pool of Radiance: Ruins of Myth Drannor is coming back!","summary":"Dear adventurers! We are happy to announce that Pool of Radiance: Ruins of Myth Drannor, a classic Dungeons & Dragons cRPG from 2001, will be re-released on Steam in Q4 2026. This will mark the first time the game is available digitally. Gather your party and set out for the elven ruins to stop a dracolich from unleashing unspeakable horrors upon Faerûn. The re-release will focus on making sure the game runs smoothly on modern systems. We'll share more details about the enhancements closer to ga","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-13T18:51:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055364204","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:47:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4834760":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:31:36Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:31:36Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4834760":"2026-10-26T14:31:36Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4834760":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:31:36Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:31:36Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:31:36Z"},"5307870":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:31:36Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:31:36Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:31:36Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"st